# ==========================================
# Obsidian 本地知识库防膨胀与隐私排除规则
# ==========================================

# 1. 临时与工作区缓存
.obsidian/workspace*
.obsidian/cache/
.obsidian/indexed-internals/
_trash/

# 2. 系统废弃文件
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.temp
*~

# 3. 超大二进制媒体防膨胀（超过 10MB 的音视频/安装包严禁入 Git 历史）
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.avi
*.mov
*.iso
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# 4. 允许轻量格式（图片与文档受控入库）
!*.md
!*.canvas
!*.base
!_attachments/*.png
!_attachments/*.jpg
!_attachments/*.jpeg
!_attachments/*.webp
!_attachments/*.svg
!_attachments/*.pdf
